==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Ginger Snache]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Sir Seal]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Relic Doge]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Professor A.]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Loris|Lorises]] spawn, delay 86.67~93.33 seconds<sup>2,600f~2,800f</sup>.
**4 [[Shadow Boxer K]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 46.67~53.33 seconds<sup>1,400f~1,600f</sup>.
**1 [[Bun Bun Black]] spawns after 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**1 [[J.K. Bun Bun]] spawns after 86.67 seconds<sup>2,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Despite this being a Zero Legends Stage, this stage looks more like an early Uncanny Legends Stage. Either way, this stage should be a pretty easy conclusion to this sub-chapter, for most players. Cats such as [[Carpenter Cat (Rare Cat)|Rapper Cat]], [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]], and [[Sushi Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Roe Cat]] can stall pretty effectively, while [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Master of Logic Mewtone]], [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cat]], and [[Ancient Egg: N101 (Rare Cat)|Courier Cat]] can deal loads of damage to the enemies, making for a quick and simple finish to a likewise simple sub-chapter.

==='''Recommended Ubers'''===
*[[Cat Clan Heroes (Uber Rare Cat)|Heavenly Cat Heroes]]: This stage was likely made for these traveling adventurers, as in their [[Ultra Form]] they can absolutely annihilate anything that stands in their path with their [[Explosion]] ability.
*[[The Grateful Crane (Uber Rare Cat)|Supernova Cosmo]]: Synergizes really well with Newtone, as both can cover each others' downtimes.

==Trivia==
*Crested Colors may have been designed specifically for [[Cat Clan Heroes (Uber Rare Cat)|Heavenly Cat Heroes]], the [[Ultra Form]] added in [[Version 15.3 Update|Version 15.3]] alongside [[Artisan's Sanctum]]. Heavenly Cat Heroes targets [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]], [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]], [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] and [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relic]], all of which appear in this stage, and cannot be cursed by [[Relic Doge]] or [[Loris]].

